    "title": "10-year service award ceremony at AKU-IED, Pakistan",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "On March 28, a ceremony was held at AKU-IED Karimabad campus to acknowledge the services and contribution of employees who have completed 10 years of service.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "2fa07b62f19a5e30",
